protocol='The prepared dataset has 26,337 hourly rows through 25 October 2026. Training uses 18,861 origins and validation uses 2,136 origins from 19 December 2025 at 07:00 UTC through 18 March 2026 at 06:00 UTC, identical to the XRP study. Each 30-hour window ends at its forecast origin and predicts the exact +24-hour log return. Boundaries are purged; Robust input scaling and MinMax target scaling use only HBAR training information. Real BTC values match XRP; HBAR indicators use HBAR prices.'
