pageheading(d,'Feature equations and seed results');d.add_paragraph('Each eligible article is available at publication time rounded up to the hour. For each hour, the four numeric features are unweighted means across eligible articles in that hour. Empty-hour means are zero and the presence field identifies whether any article exists. Recency is the elapsed time since the most recent eligible article, capped at 48 hours. No manual weighted-impact equation or exponential decay is used in E1B.')
equation(d,'mean_feature(t) = sum of eligible hourly scores / hourly article count')
