d.add_heading('Why transfer needs careful interpretation',1);d.add_paragraph('XRP stance and specificity explicitly describe XRP, even when the underlying archive contains macro, regulatory or other cryptocurrency news. Their use in HBAR is a cross-asset test. HBAR-specific features were not inferred or relabelled. A shared macro event can affect both assets, but this experiment does not isolate that channel from coin-specific exposure, news collection gaps or other correlated information. Forecast errors alone cannot establish causal news effects.')
